meta {
  name: Browse products
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/shop/products?currency=USD
  auth: none
}

docs {
  **No token.** The storefront is anonymous on purpose: a shop that demands one to show a
  product page is a shop nobody indexes and nobody shares a link to.

  Served from materialized views, which are stale by construction (ADR-0020). That is safe
  because nothing here can price a basket — the cart and checkout read live tables, so a stale
  listing cannot sell at the wrong price. The worst case is a customer seeing an old figure and
  checkout refusing with `PRICE_CHANGED`.
}
